    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Tier 2 — Tarot Mage</strong></p><p><strong>“Your practice has habits now. So do your consequences.”</strong></p><p>You are no longer just reading possibility. You are nudging it. Not enough to control the whole spread — just enough to make one bad outcome arrive somewhere else first.</p><p><strong>Strategic (Faction Scale)</strong></p><ul><li>Once per Scenario, after a key faction check is rolled but before consequences fully resolve, you may <strong>tilt the draw</strong> and add <strong>+2</strong> to the result</li><li>Alternatively, reduce the severity of one failed narrative consequence by one step, as adjudicated by the GM</li></ul><p><strong>Cost:</strong> fate remembers interference. When you soften one outcome, another edge tends to sharpen. Expect displacement, ironic timing, or a later complication that feels suspiciously connected.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"tarotT2\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Tilt the Draw</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Scenario &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Strategic &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">After a key faction check, +2 to result OR reduce severity of one failed consequence by one step.</div>\n</div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
